    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.poster.avif?t=1754597219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.webm?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.mp4?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.poster.avif?t=1754597219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.webm?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.mp4?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2fa8ee667a53eb2c3eb4666375b6d724.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mell, a space explorer, receives a strange signal from an unknown planet. Interested in the possible rewards, she heads toward the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As she approaches to investigate, a strange force field takes control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being dragged into the atmosphere, Mell enters the escape module and avoids a direct impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, trapped on an unknown planet, Mell needs to find a way to her ship and escape from this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/f67a747b65cb917f3c0e2b5227fd5df7.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/8abc1c259673db699e9968983b993f95.avif?t=1754597219\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/70507afefc8cb03f5f36d1a16655b1bc.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/4727a0c9a00759ce9312f6a1d26a5441.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* </strong>nostalgic retro art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Explore 60 levels among 3 worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Many enemies, obstacles, and challenging gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Discover the plot of this desolate place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Find other lost explorers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* </strong>Defeat the Lords of the Unknown Planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1754597219\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.poster.avif?t=1754597219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.webm?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/250d219950eb811a2be72a0143186174.mp4?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.poster.avif?t=1754597219\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.webm?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2735bbe7841f24688a8b181ad3bd6b39.mp4?t=1754597219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/2fa8ee667a53eb2c3eb4666375b6d724.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mell, a space explorer, receives a strange signal from an unknown planet. Interested in the possible rewards, she heads toward the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As she approaches to investigate, a strange force field takes control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being dragged into the atmosphere, Mell enters the escape module and avoids a direct impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, trapped on an unknown planet, Mell needs to find a way to her ship and escape from this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/f67a747b65cb917f3c0e2b5227fd5df7.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/8abc1c259673db699e9968983b993f95.avif?t=1754597219\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/70507afefc8cb03f5f36d1a16655b1bc.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/4727a0c9a00759ce9312f6a1d26a5441.webp?t=1754597219\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* </strong>nostalgic retro art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Explore 60 levels among 3 worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Many enemies, obstacles, and challenging gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Discover the plot of this desolate place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> Find other lost explorers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>* </strong>Defeat the Lords of the Unknown Planet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2100410/extras/b8ebb48ba08cc915a948f052d9a3ac50.avif?t=1754597219\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
